            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If the bearer makes a successful Psychic test that includes two or more dice of the same number, the power has been manifested with such unstoppable force that the target unit cannot choose to take a Deny the Witch test.</characteristic>
