          <rules>
            <rule name="Ark of Unnameable Horror" id="ce3a-10f3-5090-001a" hidden="false">
              <description>Any enemy shooting against the Proteus must take a Pinning test. If it passes, it may fire as normal. If it fails, it goes to ground and may not fire.

Does not apply to weapons firing without LoS, Fearless units or units without as Ld Characteristic.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
