          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The Drakescale Plate confers a 2+ armour save. In addition, the wearer has a 2++ against all flamer weapons (as defined in BRB).</characteristic>
