      <rules>
        <rule name="Shatter Defences" id="bffc-4733-548a-8e1f" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>After deployment, but before scout/infiltrate etc...

Nominate one piece of terrain in the enemy deployment zone (that is not a purchased fortification). Reduce the cover save of that terrain by 1 for the entirety of the game.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Master of Mechanisms" id="d25c-ad4d-3819-f89e" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>Master of Mechanisms, at the start of the shooting phase, the controlling player may choose to do the following options instead of shoot.

Repair a vehicle (in base contact or embarked upon): Roll a D6 (+1 for mechatendrils). On a 5+, the vehicle may regain a lost Hull Point or repair a weapon destroyed/immobilised result.

Curse: Roll to hit as per normal againt one enemy vehicle within 18&quot;. If successful, the enemy vehicles weapons have gets hot until the end of its next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
